  <data name="Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>## What's New in Audibly Fork 2.2.11

### New

- **Import several folders at once**: pick several folders in the import dialog; each folder with audio files becomes a book.
- **Book and chapter progress together**: a small line under the progress bar shows the other one. Click it to switch between total, time remaining and percent.
- **Chapters in Read Along**: choose a chapter from the ebook's table of contents; text and audiobook jump there. A line shows how far you have read.

### Fixes

- A tall cover no longer stretches its tile in the library.
- The second progress line counts listening time, so its seconds no longer run faster at higher speeds.
- "Look up online…": bold words keep their place in the description, results of both shops show up, and the Audible ID is only saved when something is taken over.
- The donate link in Settings points to the fork author.

All changes: github.com/NicolasHartmann/Audibly#changelog</value>
